@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/auth

### 1 – registrieren (role wird ignoriert)
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"  Ada  ","email":" ADA@Example.com ","password":"sicher-genug-1","role":"trainer"}

### 2 – noch einmal → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Ada","email":"ada@example.com","password":"sicher-genug-1"}

### 3 – Regeln verletzt → 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"A","email":"kaputt","password":"passwort"}

### 4 – Feld fehlt → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"x@example.com","password":"sicher-genug-1"}

### 5 – wer bin ich? (Cookie aus 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me

### 8 – falsches Passwort
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"teilnehmer@example.com","password":"falsch-123"}

### 9 – unbekannte E-Mail
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"niemand@example.com","password":"falsch-123"}

### 10 – leeres Passwort
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"teilnehmer@example.com","password":""}

### 11 – absichtlicher Serverfehler
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"server-fehler@example.com","password":"egal"}

### 12 – Demo-Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"Teilnehmer@example.com","password":"kurs-demo-123"}

### 13 – abmelden
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout

### 14 – danach
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
